  "title": "Cod with Lemon, Garlic, and Chives",
  "description": "Simple baked foil pouches contain a fillet of cod, fresh lemon slices, garlic, and chopped chives for a flavor combination that enhances the taste of the fresh fish.",
  "authors": [
